  "description": "# SIP2.24: Add 8 Arks to LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 8 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_WETH Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x2E6abcbCCeD9Af05bc3B8a4908e0c98c29A88e10\n- Number of Arks to add: 8\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x2E8a733d044Dd96BCa3584caab61c5CBb69B50Bc`\n2. `0xf38a864a23C553694BEE0cc3A73a2d9022f77dAa`\n3. `0xf2b2cF1C1f211cc5d31b4cd9d33615fc3e3eE114`\n4. `0xe885a960a34841BD639C03e70E9B55150f456E2B`\n5. `0xb5Bc81Fcc36C2e4320b8fA9a268728c309019716`\n6. `0x8c98788cdA451c9a4cCD4Cd93A5bF67147f12Ab9`\n7. `0x0264f3A10526B5Eb5F75Eb4004Df6E3Ccc3b45e3`\n8. `0xdc931F070DFe8680CE0c76e16D8b626ab7b49CE9`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-24-update-arks-from-core-protocols-on-mainnet-fleets-usdc-weth-usdt/330\n",
